 a CSS regression that evicts the player is caught, not just 'snippet visible'.\",\n    \"Stored 300-char snippets can be truncated mid-word or carry leading/trailing whitespace and pre-wrap shows that verbatim; accepted — fixing backend construction would change stored data and force re-ingest (out of scope).\",\n    \"The E2E journey (harness/e2e.py, protected and unread) could assume a content-column shape; the change is additive below the player, so any regression surfaces in the daily full run, not the quick PR gate.\",\n    \"Programme item 2 (focus entry/restoration) edits the same component and tests; this issue must not pre-implement focus work — keep the diff minimal so the follow-up candidate starts from a clean base.\"\n  ],\n  \"ambiguities\": [],\n  \"dependencies\": []\n}\n"},"ticket.json":{"sha256":"3dc7b4fd10f10c125323b04b9bff26457f01a2b854b83022b901b12d42a4d3f7","text":"{\"acceptance\":[\"AC-1\",\"AC-2\",\"AC-3\",\"AC-4\",\"AC-5\"],\"body_sha256\":\"db6d99b3f24c8c18bb1ef1d6e0c7f9ea0f6b6024a32d4a9c3dbb708a9036b666\",\"contract_sha256\":\"040339e6c8844316bd17e867184bf439956d70c3b23b12de884a0de50b5abca0\",\"issue\":181,\"parent\":null,\"test_seams\":{\"AC-1\":\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx#CitationModal\",\"AC-2\":\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx#CitationModal\",\"AC-3\":\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx#CitationModal\",\"AC-4\":\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx#CitationModal\",\"AC-5\":\"app/frontend/src/components/CitationModal.tsx#CitationModal\"},\"title\":\"Citation inspection [transcript]\",\"version\":\"1.0\"}\n"}},"base_sha":"4b6c1e72f20147a2ee18e51dfc2e094d8836d2f0","issue":181,"issue_sha256":"81dd0f79a57c8cc68f01a052a65a3e8e3eabc03a2705171c237154c9dcfd2629","kernel_commit":"4b6c1e72f20147a2ee18e51dfc2e094d8836d2f0","note_ref":"refs/notes/dark-factory-carry","policy_sha256":"ca153d0992533b7832a3f3f02903a0c3723ef11247e32ce3eac4fa8e936c8da8","run_id":"issue-181-a1-7e02a5b6d4","version"